      {
        "id": 40822,
        "name": "Ultra Vortek",
        "summary": "Mankind must prove that it is worthy of the powers of the Ultra Vortek -- the eternal energy source for all life on Earth. Failure to meet this challenge will result in the Earth's destruction. Seven of the planet's mightiest warriors have been chosen to pit strength and cunning against the Guardian for complete control of the Ultra Vortek.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co7ueu.jpg",
        "release_date": 810259200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Fighting",
        "platform_ids": "62",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ultra-vortek",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 40823,
        "name": "SuperCross 3D",
        "summary": "Supercross 3D brings the excitement of arena supercross racing to the Jaguar. Not only do you get to race ahead of your competitors, you can catch big air on the huge jumps and perform a few tricks.\nThere are three game modes: Practice, Single Race, and Tournament. In practice mode, you can race around any track for as long as you like. In single race mode, you compete in one race against the computer. Finally, in tournament mode, you compete in a series of races to accumulate points and become the Supercross champion.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co68kt.jpg",
        "release_date": 820454400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing,Sport",
        "platform_ids": "62",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/supercross-3d",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 40824,
        "name": "Super Burnout",
        "summary": "This game will get your adrenaline pumping and pin you to your seat with its 'G' force. As you lean into the first bend you'll feel like you're really there.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5ysy.jpg",
        "release_date": 791596800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "62",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/super-burnout",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 40827,
        "name": "Iron Soldier 2",
        "summary": "Iron Soldier 2 is a first-person 3D giant mech game. Players must pilot their building-sized robots in a variety of missions ranging from search-and-destroy to surgical attacks to defending objectives. Starting with a limited set of weapons, players can collect more armaments throughout the game. Each weapon can be mounted on a certain part of the robot's body, but once mounted, no other weapons can be placed there. So, while there is a wide range of weapon configurations, not every weapon can be combined with others. Players can destroy buildings in levels to find crates containing new weapons and extra ammunition for current weapons.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8s.jpg",
        "release_date": 883440000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Shooter,Simulator",
        "platform_ids": "62,410",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/iron-soldier-2",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 40828,
        "name": "AirCars",
        "summary": "Designed by Midnight Entertainment Group in 1995, ICD released AirCars in limited numbers. No real box was made (it came shrinkwrapped inside a box insert), but the cartridge included a label and manual, along with a picture of what the overlay might look like. This is an action/battle game in which you must destroy enemy bases while in your Air Car, and it supports up to 8 players using CatBoxes or 2 players using a JagLink. Although better graphics can be found on the Jaguar and control is a bit sluggish, linking 8 players using CatBoxes can be a unique experience. The hard part will be finding those extra CatBoxes and copies of AirCars.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co5dju.jpg",
        "release_date": 867369600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Shooter,Simulator",
        "platform_ids": "62",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/aircars",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 46923,
        "name": "World Tour Racing",
        "summary": "World Tour Racing was the first racer available for the Atari Jaguar CD. Earlier cartridge games, like Super Burnout and Checkered Flag were received with mixed reviews, which created some excitement for the release of WTR. Gameplay includes customizable cars, seven different racing views, and surprisingly intelligent AI. World Tour Racing also features a damage system -- too many mid-race collisions will force drivers to the pits.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8v.jpg",
        "release_date": 865209600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "410",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/world-tour-racing",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 46924,
        "name": "Hover Strike: Unconquered Lands",
        "summary": "Hover Strike is a futuristic 3D action game where you pilot a lone hovercraft in a series of missions against overwhelming enemy forces. You must use your speed, firepower, and displays to outfight and outwit the enemy. The game presents a series of missions which must be completed before you can advance. Goals include destroying a certain number or type of enemy units. The missions take place in a variety of different planetary environments.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co3z29.jpg",
        "release_date": 814406400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Simulator",
        "platform_ids": "410",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hover-strike-unconquered-lands",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 46925,
        "name": "Highlander: The Last of the MacLeods",
        "summary": "Quentin McCloud must rescue clan members during a journey across his world in this game for the Jaguar CD. Quentin is portrayed in 3D, as are his enemies, but most of his world is in 2D (much like Alone in the Dark and Resident Evil). Unfortunately, the 3D polygon construction of the characters is hideous, though the backgrounds and cut scenes are well done. The first-person control scheme has promise, but suffers from multiple problems. If Quentin is attacked from behind, by the time he pivots, he's usually dead. Highlander is a mediocre game deserving of consideration from Highlander fans but, even considering the scarcity of Jaguar CD titles, probably best left alone by others.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8q.jpg",
        "release_date": 815011200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "410",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/highlander-the-last-of-the-macleods",
        "cached_at": 1778663165
      },
      {
        "id": 70194,
        "name": "Battlemorph",
        "summary": "Vehicle-based 3D shooter that was released exclusively on the Jaguar CD peripheral, and is the sequel to the original Jaguar pack-in game Cybermorph.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1p8o.jpg",
        "release_date": 811641600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Shooter,Simulator",
        "platform_ids": "410",
